{"steam_appid":1430760,"steam_name":"Aquarist","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1430760/484418361/14827c3383166a1f4906cd6f22f2917000406e92/1786633825/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1786639891","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257398349/733a9012b19b8ff7997aec5dbace0c43940ae431/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1786639891","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/ss_a02c0c1556cd71b58ee83231aad713b1dbc9b2ec.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786639894","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/ss_077f1a896d72e4f117f9599dd68dbc92eadf7caa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786639894","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/ss_b0226344024efce31b11ab8318571c657e284ad8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786639894","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/ss_1dc0fbe1944c94bdd87be1d98e3ced867169c366.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786639894","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/ss_616a1796c1686f492249df054842c2d5fc257052.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786639894"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Design, build, and manage incredible aquariums in <strong>Aquarist</strong> – a relaxing aquarium simulator where creativity meets business management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Create beautiful freshwater and saltwater tanks, care for exotic aquatic animals, complete unique customer jobs, run your own aquarium store, and expand from a small local business into a spectacular oceanarium. Whether you enjoy creative building, management simulation, or relaxing sandbox gameplay, Aquarist lets you create the aquarium of your dreams.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD YOUR DREAM AQUARIUM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/1ad5cf3c57d305749c403da9a53d0062.poster.avif?t=1786639894\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/1ad5cf3c57d305749c403da9a53d0062.webm?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/1ad5cf3c57d305749c403da9a53d0062.mp4?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Create aquariums exactly the way you want.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose tank sizes, layouts, decorations, plants, rocks, backgrounds, and equipment to build anything from a peaceful nature-inspired aquascape to a luxurious underwater exhibit. Every aquarium is fully customizable—even the background can use your own photos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Experiment with endless design possibilities and create unique aquariums that reflect your imagination.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>RUN YOUR OWN AQUARIUM BUSINESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/f2bb2a543b5b91c6d34e842061cb3ee5.poster.avif?t=1786639894\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/f2bb2a543b5b91c6d34e842061cb3ee5.webm?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/f2bb2a543b5b91c6d34e842061cb3ee5.mp4?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Start with a small aquarium shop and grow your business.</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Complete customer orders, earn money, unlock new equipment, purchase rare fish and decorations, and expand into larger locations. Every successful project helps you develop your aquarium empire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CARE FOR AMAZING AQUATIC ANIMALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/95479a56ba00435ce95976b94990def5.poster.avif?t=1786639894\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/95479a56ba00435ce95976b94990def5.webm?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/95479a56ba00435ce95976b94990def5.mp4?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Keep freshwater and saltwater species healthy and thriving.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look after tropical fish, sharks, rays, sea turtles, octopuses, shrimp, cuttlefish, arapaima, corals, and many more fascinating aquatic creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Maintain proper water conditions, feed your animals, and create environments where every species can flourish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COMPLETE UNIQUE PROJECTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/e88b0a7331c1728403b7fc17c91aa624.poster.avif?t=1786639894\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/e88b0a7331c1728403b7fc17c91aa624.webm?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/e88b0a7331c1728403b7fc17c91aa624.mp4?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>No two jobs are the same.</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Design aquariums for museums, bars, restaurants, private homes, and unusual locations around the world. Build turtle habitats, create decorative piranha tanks, renovate neglected aquariums, and solve increasingly creative challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every project introduces new mechanics, rewards, and opportunities to expand your collection. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GROW INTO AN AQUARIUM EMPIRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/81ede8678f4e0e7be252017a5157783f.poster.avif?t=1786639894\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/81ede8678f4e0e7be252017a5157783f.webm?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1430760/extras/81ede8678f4e0e7be252017a5157783f.mp4?t=1786639894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Unlock new buildings and larger attractions as your reputation grows.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Expand beyond your aquarium shop into exhibition halls, an aquatic museum, and even a massive oceanarium filled with spectacular marine life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Whether you prefer relaxing decoration, business management, or completing unusual aquarium projects, Aquarist offers hours of satisfying sandbox gameplay where every aquarium is your own creation.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 23 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 23 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["FreeMind S.A."],"publishers":["PlayWay S.A.","FreeMind S.A."],"release_date":"Mar 29, 2024"}